<section class="admin-panel">
  <h2>How the dashboard works</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🏠 Dashboard</h3><p>Your day at a glance — upcoming bookings, students, articles, session records, and today's schedule.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🗓️ Availability</h3><p>Set class durations, the break between sessions, how far ahead students can book, and the weekly grid (in-studio / online / closed per day). Holiday periods block those dates on the public calendar; holiday mode pauses booking entirely. Changed durations or breaks? Re-check your grid — the slot math changes with them.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>📒 Bookings</h3><p>Every booking in one list. Change status, reschedule to a new date/time, or send a one-tap WhatsApp reminder. Add bookings manually — typing a name autofills existing students.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>📆 Calendar</h3><p>Monthly, weekly, or daily view of all bookings. Personal events show for you only and never consume public booking slots.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🧑‍🎨 Students</h3><p>Profiles are created automatically from bookings (phone number is the identifier). Open a profile for session records — rich text plus PDF/photo uploads — a filled waiver PDF, and quick notes. Archive students you no longer teach.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>✍️ Blog</h3><p>Write with the formatting toolbar, add a cover image and category, choose Draft or Published. Published posts appear on the public site immediately.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>❓ FAQs</h3><p>These render as the accordion on the public homepage.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🌐 Web management</h3><p>Preview and activate themes, override images (hero, logo, favicon), edit every public phrase, set contact and social links, configure Gmail notifications, and edit the waiver template.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🌓 Light / dark</h3><p>The toggle in the top bar switches the dashboard and remembers your choice on this device.</p></article>
    <article class="faq-item"><h3>🔎 Search</h3><p>The top-bar search finds students, bookings, blog posts, session records, and FAQs from one box.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
